;">Whom does AI benefit?</h2></div></td></tr>
<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Two stories recently published in the Guar=
dian=E2=80=99s <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u00=
1.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFeM1cQu1kC6=
EQHmwwqT01WLmrC73rnShsB7USm8WGaGvZA77wO2i32WxpBPGD_5obU4iZ2X-RNeeg9BaHN7k_E=
P3zoDJWqTl5-97TGbghxYlptZxyCEK9O07nEj77W8mTwQw5vKJjZDGkyCPxjkuEvtdTiCAjirJc=
1nMrR1nErw_YQZ62OGcMU7S3ClXetQEThohtvTdmPxokQngMVGEd0Pg/4uu/VtlneAhjSo2AbLa=
feqrnGQ/h24/h001.6BQ4DvdO-zW_bfP4UkXhzFgDUpY1r40_v86EI77h40c" style=3D"colo=
r: #0077B6;">Reworked</a> series pose the question: who is AI enriching?</p=
>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The first story details how the AI boom is=
 leaving women out of the single largest engine of growth in the US economy=
. One visible example: Donald Trump=E2=80=99s all-male summit of AI leaders=
 last week: not a single woman in sight as <a href=3D"https://ablink.editor=
ial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEA13=
-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFeoyOMWdUB2m3bNlrQFCD3w029PfAzAi-Afv9EQVD6d3xHuQ_yiWBTWyWd=
jrYDs_yLWevbeyCvE3hHru3s862GTi5o0TByRf4I8VnrXO0Uc98MVJT8neXoNhA5G74xRd1nw88=
zwdpEu9yB7DQ6iB1yFjHbloKbb84iFqpzMy4N6XmRm0sncng95OCIz7bHieEgHjDJW9hmY6dZbO=
mtzja1cQ/4uu/VtlneAhjSo2AbLafeqrnGQ/h25/h001.Ee5K4R3eGQxnmws42hXUsVVTufN7Mq=
4nlGmHsdDnFCo" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">the president preached the power o=
f =E2=80=9Csuperintelligence=E2=80=9D</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CWe=E2=80=99re talking about who c=
aptures a major new source of economic mobility,=E2=80=9D said Felicia Newh=
ouse, founder of AI Powered Women, an organization that promotes women=E2=
=80=99s participation and leadership in AI. =E2=80=9CThe deepest risk is th=
at a participation gap becomes a power gap.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Read more: <a href=3D"https://abli=
nk.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszc=
CSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFeBR6S4jFBx9UwJaEpJRC6GExnUTS_UuQr-k24CcyXglSYS_i=
zMUFBApDM3jk3mB5bs3dA56EO-DflI4bRyQhkaRDorunuQfBuBynt2cz3pBGDcrl2qiqRvUjQrJ=
JrfvOmM6spquRTOQi-d-oBp_T4iwOA5oKPMUMBoeGoCGQyU1BlHyX2XqTop5hY_3cr3LE_V-cc3=
-_nqk8l4hT9O3Gqpg/4uu/VtlneAhjSo2AbLafeqrnGQ/h26/h001.si_cwxTSeunF60jQ5YwWD=
NQfkAO3CgXmgDoNTVWt4-Y" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">The AI industry is boomin=
g. Women are getting left behind</a></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Across AI-related occupations, the median =
pay of men is $45,000 higher than that of women, partly due to the types of=
 jobs men and women are more likely to have, according to research by Linke=
dIn: men are still typically hired for higher-paying roles in the AI indust=
ry.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">When pitching investors, one female co-fou=
nder of an AI startup said she has found through trial and error that she a=
nd her male co-founder are more likely to get an investment if he does the =
pitching.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Another story in the series examines how d=
ire working conditions can become under the pressures of AI and automation.=
 Refugees in Kenya are completing tasks for foreign technology companies un=
der bizarre and opaque conditions.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The stories of desperate remote data worke=
rs used to highlight the low pay and horrid content they were exposed to. T=
oday, workers who spoke to the Guardian say they aren=E2=80=99t even sure t=
hey will be paid, as their compensation is tied to a so-called =E2=80=9Crew=
ard=E2=80=9D system that decides whether they receive payment based on the =
quality of their work. Many of the workers called the system unfair but als=
o said with dismay that they had few, if any, other options.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Read more: <a href=3D"https://abli=
nk.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszc=
CSneHEDemkX49beNf88r4VT8N5woecvNdfgmoHoCFYqs1M2zELXqWTqeU_DW_wRSIvddz10m_Bn=
7OIs489usMMHlkpnHuhx1ujEH09hMxzLULk58vrRA7Wj4DrcuLselI2X-IfElxshWkXpQb0vFzX=
Tq3jHAGr2s2g9l1KVKdr0C3zu2jv0ebNzH9d3nD0ruimSmm6c_zMlVSaQvLPC4AfDSk8XvTBKQC=
33eGwZsHe6d1QxA3Nmuyx0xUhApJJ_dlwgykYU/4uu/VtlneAhjSo2AbLafeqrnGQ/h27/h001.=
hRFd7h4J8Ku-qKZwl-8Ck4I5YRrN0kbQKFr3SB4Fk4Y" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">=E2=
=80=98Someone else will do it for less=E2=80=99: refugees in Kenya are powe=
ring tech for dwindling pay</a></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The workers in Kenya also expressed a desp=
eration to earn any money at these jobs before AI could carry out the rote =
tasks they were assigned.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Contrast these stories of unequal benefit =
with Sam Altman=E2=80=99s recent remarks on a podcast: =E2=80=9CWe believe =
that the world should accept some bad things happening for the benefits of =
this technology.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Altman was referring to the consequences o=
f AI like the <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001=
.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFejX3PaQY6x8=
TGERbQbXs_PA3sEaZ3KwK3FP5BGkna9FfUvCZ_66BaU_lp8qssmGgYGl_OPxZmJh6D27HTbK8d1=
6tY71dWRU6f6ExUSL5VcAAl7ZDgnxGB0wZJdSHIGTPKnMPpkUZA1ws7EiezkOgEFTSdKIoCdnOt=
rKnNzyvNHz67hhVwKh_wCCuJ-PNAfDAZ8XWJS2o39TNiRqe9B3T4pRUuImNZSFcXhMAc0UspnFQ=
9EgUdlGJD_zmwwCUpUsEDmtbn4Ua8YRtHoxPzW2CR5A/4uu/VtlneAhjSo2AbLafeqrnGQ/h28/=
h001.gtBGoOw7GcfznUCeNG7va988TwvqZtf3-wmaJ1EjYLc" style=3D"color: #0077B6;"=
>hack of Hugging Face</a> or the <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.thegua=
rdian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3=
ZqJFCJlFeAHBG9iM4qeeVoJCFz2cejIu5pIwXB8C0QmsciwtIkqbGs7cNQEVppC3vuBWEtALLz2=
pyU-9HB3OUS54sAo9tzyYOT1PwWTO9sykg3YZsaF0FcwQxJvmgt98N3o6C1ie9rDjefsuPaXXSU=
530DxO74_CuHiAxB5dNkHb5heTYJXOQrkMjUCdcvdeWLgRCcEpBRXafVDFDaDsE87NFGY4Kw9-F=
2Qdfze9lPxgreYsRLTQ/4uu/VtlneAhjSo2AbLafeqrnGQ/h29/h001.jU5N_AfGHcMtegzKiC6=
brYrYd6zIQKU-ZqKnmtiEFuY" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">attempted creation of b=
ioweapons</a> by would-be terrorists. Bad, to be sure, but lacking the mora=
l outrage of human consequences.</p>
